<title>USA: Wheels Sports Group buys co for 485,000 shr.</title>
<headline>Wheels Sports Group buys co for 485,000 shr.</headline>
<dateline>MOCKSVILLE, N.C. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheels Sports Group Inc said Tuesday it has completed its acquisition of privately-held Diamond Sports Group for 485,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company previously announced it was acquiring the Diamond Sports for 480,000 shares.</p>
<p>Wheels Sports Group makes and collectible sports trading cards primarily featuring the race drivers, team owners and crew chiefs active in NASCAR-sanctioned motorsports racing events.</p>
</text>
